# Motions written for one avatar, on top of the built-in gesture table.
#
# Each file adds one gesture under its own filename. They are the operator's
# own, tuned against a model this repository does not ship, so they are not
# tracked — but the directory is, so there is somewhere to put one.
#
# What the format is, and why it is keyframes rather than the procedural form
# the built-in table uses, is in `docs/en/motions.md`.
*
!.gitignore
